    "updated_at": "2021-01-22T01:32:37Z",
    "body": "The solution proposed by @qmatias is no longer valid due to having `prompt_order` as a deprecated feature.\r\nA possible alternative would be:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n[$directory](yellow) [-](gray align:center-fill) [$time](white align:right)\r\n[❯](green)\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```\r\nThis would result in something like this:\r\n```\r\n~/git/starship -------------------------------- 14:53:30\r\n❯\r\n```\r\nAnd for more visibility on what's going on, here's another example:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n$directory [─](gray align:center-fill) [$time](align:right)\r\n❯\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```\r\nThis would result in\r\n```\r\n~/git/starship ──────────────────────────────── 14:53:30\r\n❯\r\n```",
