    "body": "A big issue with a starship-provided right prompt over a dedicated shell-provided `RPROMPT` is that different terminal emulators may not consistently handle character width e.g. if an emoji takes one or two columns of space which could cause the prompt line to overflow. #2009 can cause more issues beyond that. I think might be possible to query the current position to work around that though. Edit: I guess that doesn't work well with how the rendering currently works.",
